{"id":"sicherstellen","lemma":"sicherstellen","pos":"verb","rank":3703,"glosses":["to seize, confiscate a physical object as a measure to avert danger (a Gefahrenabwehrmaßnahme)","to ensure, to make sure, to guarantee"],"ipa":"/ˈzɪçɐʃtɛln̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/De-sicherstellen.ogg/De-sicherstellen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"stelle sicher","1p":"stellen sicher","2s":"stellst sicher","2p":"stellt sicher","3s":"stellt sicher","3p":"stellen sicher"},"preterite":{"1s":"stellte sicher","1p":"stellten sicher","2s":"stelltest sicher","2p":"stelltet sicher","3s":"stellte sicher","3p":"stellten sicher"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe sichergestellt","1p":"haben sichergestellt","2s":"hast sichergestellt","2p":"habt sichergestellt","3s":"hat sichergestellt","3p":"haben sichergestellt"},"future":{"1s":"werde sicherstellen","1p":"werden sicherstellen","2s":"wirst sicherstellen","2p":"werdet sicherstellen","3s":"wird sicherstellen","3p":"werden sicherstellen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"stell sicher","2p":"stellt sicher"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde sicherstellen","1p":"würden sicherstellen","2s":"würdest sicherstellen","2p":"würdet sicherstellen","3s":"würde sicherstellen","3p":"würden sicherstellen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"sichergestellt"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich will einfach sicherstellen, dass du vorbereitet bist.","en":"I just want to make sure you're prepared.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"easy"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to prepare","l":"vorbereiten"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich habe sichergestellt, dass mir niemand gefolgt ist.","en":"I made sure no one was following me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to follow","l":"folgen"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich wollte nur sicherstellen, dass du weißt, was du zu tun hast.","en":"I just wanted to make sure you knew what to do.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen sicherstellen, dass Tom nicht gewinnt.","en":"We've got to make sure Tom doesn't win.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to win","l":"gewinnen"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen sicherstellen, dass Tom das seinlässt.","en":"We have to make sure Tom doesn't do that.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"the / that"},null]}]}